        "Log feed run",
        "Get offers for Ingest",
        "Save offers",
        "Mark missing",
        "Log held run",
        "Get offers",
        "Get stock locations",
        "Get feed runs",
        "Save product links",
        "Get offers for Sweep",
        "Get retire queue",
        "Save the proposal",
        "Get queue row",
        "Save the decision"
      ],
      "help": "Your Supabase database connection string (Connect > Session pooler), for workflow-supabase.json only"
    }
  ]
